# TanStack Patterns

## TanStack Query

### Hooks in components/widgets

```typescript
// Prefer action wrappers over direct codegen hooks in widgets
import { useGetSomething } from "@/actions/<domain>/hooks/use-get-something";
```

### Preloading in route loaders

```typescript
import { getGetSessionQueryOptions } from "@/codegen/api/auth";

export const Route = createFileRoute("/path")({
  beforeLoad: async ({ context }) => {
    await context.queryClient.ensureQueryData(getGetSessionQueryOptions());
  },
});
```

### Infinite queries (pagination)

Generated hooks ending in `Infinite` use cursor/page-based pagination:
```typescript
import { useGetApiV1IdeasInfinite } from "@/codegen/api/product";

const { data, fetchNextPage, hasNextPage, isFetchingNextPage } =
  useGetApiV1IdeasInfinite({ pageSize: 20 });
// data.pages — array of page results
```

### Mutations

```typescript
import { usePostApiV1Something } from "@/codegen/api/product";

const { mutate, isPending } = usePostApiV1Something();
mutate({ body: { ... } }, {
  onSuccess: () => { queryClient.invalidateQueries(...) },
  onError: () => { toast.error(...) },
});
```

## TanStack Router

### Search params

```typescript
// Read search params in component
import { useSearch } from "@tanstack/react-router";
const { q, page } = useSearch({ from: "/_with-auth/_with-subscription/my-route" });

// Navigate with updated params
import { useNavigate } from "@tanstack/react-router";
const navigate = useNavigate();
navigate({ to: "/my-route", search: (prev) => ({ ...prev, q: "new" }), replace: true });
```

### Route params

```typescript
import { useParams } from "@tanstack/react-router";
const { id } = useParams({ from: "/_with-auth/_with-subscription/items/$id" });
```

## TanStack Form

Always use `useAppForm` from `@/lib/tanstack-form` (not bare `useForm`):

```typescript
import { useAppForm } from "@/lib/tanstack-form";
import { z } from "@/lib/zod";

const form = useAppForm({
  defaultValues: { email: "", name: "" },
  validators: { onSubmit: z.object({ email: z.email(), name: z.string().min(1) }) },
  onSubmit: async ({ value }) => { /* mutation call */ },
});
```

Available field components: `InputField`, `TextareaField`, `SelectField`,
`CheckboxChipsField`, `MultiSelectField`, `RadioCardsGroupField`.
Form components: `SubmitButton`, `ResetButton`.
